 <section className="workspace-banner" hidden={!home.workspace}><div><span className="eyebrow">YOUR OWN SPACE TO PLAN</span><h2>A big journey.<br/>A clearer next step.</h2><p>Keep your shortlist, applications and daily calendar in one private workspace. Start with your own profile and build from there.</p><a href="/register" className="button light">Create your workspace <ArrowUpRight size={17}/></a></div><div className="workspace-preview"><div className="preview-heading"><CalendarDays size={21}/><span>Your journey planner</span><span className="badge">24 hours</span></div>{[["Discover","Countries & shortlists",Globe2],["Prepare","IELTS & Bank Statements",BookOpen],["Organise","Applications & calendar",CalendarDays]].map(([a,b,I]:any,i)=><div className="preview-row" key={a}><span className="preview-num">0{i+1}</span><div><strong>{a}</strong><small>{b}</small></div><I size={19}/></div>)}<div className="preview-bottom"><LockKeyhole size={15}/> Your personal records stay private.</div></div></section>
